---@class gcp.firebaseappcheck_v1.GoogleFirebaseAppcheckV1ExchangeAppAttestAttestationResponse
---@field artifact? string An artifact that can be used in future calls to ExchangeAppAttestAssertion.
---@field appCheckToken? gcp.firebaseappcheck_v1.GoogleFirebaseAppcheckV1AppCheckToken Encapsulates an App Check token.

---Request message for the GenerateAppAttestChallenge method.
